{"data":"<div class=\"rounded bg-white h-100\">\r\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n        <div class=\"p-3\">\r\n            <div id=\"player\" class=\"d-none\"><\/div>\r\n            <h1 class=\"m-0 font-weight-600\">[U3-P3]\u30c9\u30ea\u30eb\u2462<\/h1>\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-regular fa-circle-check text-success\"><\/i>\r\n                <span class=\"pl-1 text-success\">Completed<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"activity-quiz-history-body ml-3\">\r\n                            <div class=\"activity-quiz-history-description custom-bg-gray rounded p-1 ck-content\">\r\n                    <p><strong><u>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn:&nbsp;<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p>\u1ede ph\u1ea7n n\u00e0y sinh vi\u00ean s\u1ebd l\u00e0m b\u00e0i luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp nh\u1ecf \u0111\u1ec3 \u00f4n t\u1eadp nhanh c\u00e1c m\u1eabu ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p v\u1eeba h\u1ecdc.&nbsp;<\/p><p>C\u00f3 2 d\u1ea1ng b\u00e0i:&nbsp;<\/p><ol><li>N\u1ed1i m\u1eabu ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p v\u1edbi ngh\u0129a ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n \u0111\u00fang (d\u1ea1ng tr\u1eafc nghi\u1ec7m).<\/li><\/ol><p><strong><u>Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u:<\/u><\/strong>&nbsp;<br>Sinh vi\u00ean l\u00e0m \u0111\u00fang h\u1ebft t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"d-flex-not-important align-items-center my-3\">\r\n                    <a class=\"rounded btn btn-outline-primary max-content mr-2\" class=\"\"  href=\"https:\/\/digital.nix.edu.vn\/learning\/activity\/download-quiz-pdf\/1755?html=0\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-download\"><\/i>\r\n                        Download sample as PDF\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"mr-2\">\r\n                        or\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n\r\n                    <a class=\"rounded btn btn-outline-primary max-content m